opam-version: "2.0"
version: "0.1.0~alpha1"
synopsis: "MirageOS transport for the TON liteserver client"
description: """
Drives the liteserver protocol over any Mirage_flow.S -- a TCP connection,
a vsock channel out of a confidential guest, or an in-memory pipe in a test.
The caller opens the flow; no protocol code lives here."""
maintainer: ["Gil Bahat <bahat.gil@gmail.com>"]
authors: ["Gil Bahat <bahat.gil@gmail.com>"]
license: "ISC"
homepage: "https://github.com/reuna-labs/ocaml-ton"
